pons or use an unrelated attack type. Preserve exact original face/hair/skin, armor/costume, colors, anatomical equipment hand, weapon shape and number, and body proportions. Distinct articulated joint poses only; no generic model, static rotation/translation, copying, mirroring or tweened still. Background outside each figure is alpha zero.  Preserved current healthy IDLE guards are frames0 and5 of the assembled action; do not redraw either. Generate ONLY four middle articulated action poses, in a 2x2 sheet. The appended current guard source is the accepted facing/identity reference. Preserve its exact camera, costume, equipment and body proportions. The old erroneous IDLE source is not a camera authority. No new guard, crop inference or middle-pose copying.",
